 ## Using it
+
+**Disc formats:** the launcher and runtime accept GDI, CUE, CHD, and DiscJuggler CDI
+(v2/v3/v3.5) images. CDI is read directly without extraction or conversion. Disc selection still
+requires the exact boot executable revision used to build the port; format support does not
+make other game revisions compatible. The Python source-build extraction tools are separate.
 
